<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mirage rated hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mirage rated hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co said analyst Dennis Forst initiated Mirage Resorts Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- estimates earnings of $1.11 per share for 1997, and $1.28 for 1998 compared to $1.06 for 1996.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/4 to 21-1/4.</p>
</text>
